WEBVTT

1
00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:29.560
As if sinking, as if melting away

2
00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:45.220
on a night when a sky just for the two of us spreads wide

3
00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:50.890
It was only “goodbye”

4
00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:55.610
and with that one word I understood everything

5
00:00:55.610 --> 00:01:01.190
The sky as the sun began to set, and you

6
00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:06.310
overlapping beyond the fence

7
00:01:06.310 --> 00:01:09.890
Ever since the day we first met

8
00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:14.690
you took all of my heart

9
00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:20.450
You, wrapped in an air that seemed somehow fleeting,

10
00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:25.210
had such lonely eyes

11
00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:27.430
Always, tick-tock,

12
00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:29.750
in this ringing world, again and again

13
00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:32.570
heartless words and noisy voices brush against you

14
00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:35.830
and even when tears are about to spill

15
00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:44.670
ordinary joys — together, I know we can find them

16
00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:50.370
To you, who can’t smile in these noisy days,

17
00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:55.470
the brightest tomorrow I can imagine

18
00:01:55.470 --> 00:02:00.630
Before you fall into a night that never ends

19
00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:04.910
take my hand, come on

20
00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:11.110
Even the days you locked away, wanting to forget,

21
00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:16.270
I’ll melt them with the warmth of my embrace

22
00:02:16.270 --> 00:02:22.890
So don’t be afraid — until the sun rises someday

23
00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:28.920
let’s stay together

24
00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:39.150
Something only you can see

25
00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:43.510
I hate you when you stare at it

26
00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:48.710
as if entranced, as if in love

27
00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:52.920
I hate that look on your face

28
00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:55.230
Things I want to believe but can’t

29
00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:57.350
no matter what we do, I’m sure

30
00:02:57.350 --> 00:02:59.170
there will be many more from now on

31
00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:01.550
and every time we’ll get angry and cry

32
00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:04.910
Even so, surely, someday, surely, we’ll surely

33
00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:10.920
understand each other — I believe it

34
00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:29.810
“I’ve had enough,” “I’m tired,” you say

35
00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:36.030
and shake off the hand I reached out so desperately

36
00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:38.870
“I’ve had enough, I’m tired” —

37
00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:44.260
honestly, I want to say it too

38
00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:46.390
There it goes again, tick-tock,

39
00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:48.610
in this ringing world, again and again

40
00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:52.570
none of the words I prepared for you reach you

41
00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:55.150
“I want to end it”

42
00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:57.770
and when, drawn in, I said it too,

43
00:03:57.770 --> 00:04:05.740
you smiled for the first time

44
00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:11.990
I had forgotten how to smile in these noisy days

45
00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:16.430
and you, in my eyes, are beautiful

46
00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:20.610
Even the tears spilled in the endless night

47
00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:27.010
melt away into your smile

48
00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:31.750
Me, who cried through the unchanging days,

49
00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:36.250
you gently lead toward the end

50
00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:40.830
As if sinking, as if melting away

51
00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:44.470
the fog that clung to me clears

52
00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:49.830
Into the days I locked away, wanting to forget,

53
00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:54.330
I take the hand you reached out to me

54
00:04:54.330 --> 00:05:02.070
a cool wind blows through now, as if swimming across the sky

55
00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:06.850
Don’t let go of the hand you’re holding

56
00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:12.220
now, the two of us run out into the night
